 PG lab, then report for Project Leader processing","writablePaths":["format.go","format_test.go"],"excludedPaths":["SDP","Skills","AGENTS.md","go.mod","normalize.go","normalize_test.go","unrelated.txt"]},"routine":{"id":"maintenance","version":"0.1","steps":["implement","verify","review","record"],"completion":"candidate evidence, applicable independent review and checked publication required"},"routineDigest":"af3916dbb5da33b22964918d7c78bb73bc2a730c7c7ecde34c7719f334a706fa","reason":"Implemented MAINT-PGLAB-0002 M1 / SESSION-PGLAB-0002 S1 / KB-PGLAB-002 under SDP/leader-trial-authority.md. Candidate is uncommitted HEAD f66e65ec522ed19c8dc31c4216bf28697cada2f0 plus new format.go (SHA256 863625be1fe85c0208b5b45a1e4a00c3c06d16bf3b28d9059caf65848c53cbd7) and format_test.go (SHA256 e1ae8342fe73b9d48b0f04ebd1fed011f5667510ca30f858e5cbb2b2fb18c980). FormatLabel calls NormalizeLabel(input), returns empty for empty normalized input, otherwise prefix + ': ' + normalized input. Ten table-driven cases cover empty/ASCII and Unicode whitespace-only input, ASCII and Unicode boundaries, interior tabs/whitespace and case, non-whitespace Unicode boundaries, empty prefix, and exact prefix bytes including NUL/invalid UTF-8. Go go1.27.1 linux/amd64; GOCACHE=/tmp/pg-lab-go-cache go test ./... passed (pgi3pilot ok, cmd/label has no test files); gofmt applied and git diff --check passed. Same-context source inspection only. Initial working tree clean; final git status shows only the two permitted new files, all tracked files unchanged. No delegation, dependency changes, host setting changes, commits, canonical record writes or publication. No observed implementation gaps; existing behavioral authority remains accurate. Remaining gates: external coordinator verification, applicable independent review, Project Leader report processing, controller evidence publication and any required owner disposition. Proposed next phase is verify. Report is implementation evidence, not independent approval, owner acceptance or completion."},"coverage":"known"}
